   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "<h1>ee.c</h1>\n\n<pre><code>#include&lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include&lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include&lt;unistd.h&gt;\n\n int main( void )\n{\n    int *ptr = NULL;\n\n    while ( 1 )\n    {\n        ptr = (int*) malloc ( 1024 );\n        sleep ( 2 );\n    }\n    return ( 0 );\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n<ol>\n<li>gcc -o memory ee.c</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h1>mem_leak.sh</h1>\n\n<pre><code>#!/bin/bash\necho \" memory leak script started\"\n./memory\n</code></pre>\n\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>chmod 777 mem_leak.sh</li>\n<li>./mem_leak.sh</li>\n</ol>\n"
  },
